# Signing material. `eas credentials` writes a downloaded keystore into the
# working directory, and credentials.json holds its passwords in plain text.
# Both are the upload key for com.mmsb.borelog *and* com.mmsb.borelog.pub --
# Play expects one certificate (08:E2:AA:83...) for both listings -- so a
# committed copy is a compromise of both apps at once.
